-`CA (1 + log u) (T(n, 9u) + n²)` with the explicit constant `CA`; `pairsFromAllEdges` delivers the
-transfer `PairsFromAllEdges CA` that the chain `ImprovedExponents.AllEdges.Chain` consumes.
