-    rcases hc with ⟨rfl, rfl⟩ | ⟨hℓ, rfl | rfl⟩
-    · exact Or.inl hf
-    · exact Or.inr ⟨ℓ, by omega, Or.inl hf⟩
-    · exact Or.inr ⟨ℓ, by omega, Or.inr hf⟩
