-    · exact ⟨(ℓ, 3), mem_insert_of_mem (mem_product.mpr ⟨mem_range.mpr (by omega), by simp⟩), h⟩
-
-/-- Lemma F for integers `p, q` of absolute value at most `W` and a threshold `t` with
-`0 ≤ t + 2W < 2^b`, where `2W < 2^b`. -/
