+  ⟨x.tab, x.fr+3*u, ⟨x.fr,r.a.mat n x.a.values⟩,⟨x.fr+u,r.b.mat n x.b.values⟩,⟨x.fr+2*u,r.c.mat n x.c.values⟩⟩
