-    Z.map (prefQ L) = affL 0 0 Z :=
-  List.map_congr_left fun z hz => by simp [prefQ_start (h z hz).1 (h z hz).2]
-
-/-- The shifted and doubled weights: `2x = 2 (w(a,b) + U)`, `2y = 2 (w(b,c) + U)`,
-`2v = 2 (2U - w(a,c))`, one list after the other. -/
